  <h1>Lets Start With:</h1>
  <h2>The Characters Of Genshin Impact</h2>
  <p>The Characters:</p>

  <hr>

  <h3>This is Flins</h3>
  <p><b>The Lore of Flins:</b></p>
  <p>
    <mark>Flins</mark> is the last surviving Snowland Fae, serving as the reclusive <mark>Lighthouse Keeper</mark> of Nod-Krai.<br>
    Haunted by the traumatic loss of his fallen comrades against the Abyss, he escaped reality into a long, deep slumber.<br>
    After finally awakening, his path crosses with the <mark>Traveler</mark>, to whom he surprisingly reveals his true mystical nature.
  </p>
  <img src="https://encrypted-tbn0.gstatic.com/images?q=tbn:ANd9GcS6hF30sMBhCq3vt1OeTyuolehzak-1C31XtR76LKEG_McGBXLRxK4y_PJ6&s=10" alt="Genshin" width="500" height="800">

  <hr>

  <h3>Here we got <mark>Shogun</mark> (The ruler of the Land of Eternity)</h3>
  <p><b>Her Lore:</b></p>
  <p>
    The <mark>Raiden Shogun</mark> is the vessel of the Electro Archon, seeking a frozen <mark>"Eternity"</mark> for Inazuma after losing her loved ones to tragedy.<br>
    To escape the erosion of time, she shut her soul inside a sword and created a puppet to rule the nation.<br>
    Her ruthless isolation was finally broken when the <mark>Traveler</mark> arrived and challenged her ideals.
  </p>
  <img src="https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/genshin-impact/images/e/ec/Raiden_Karte.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20211123185857&path-prefix=de" alt="Raiden" width="500" height="800">

  <hr>

  <h3>And here would be The Traveler (you can choose between them)</h3>
  <p><b>The Travelers have alot of Lore and much still hasn´t been enlightened, but here is a small cutout:</b></p>
  <p>
    The <mark>Traveler</mark> is a world-hopping twin who lost their sibling to a mysterious deity upon arriving in Teyvat.<br>
    Stripped of their original power and stuck in an unfamiliar world, they embark on a grand journey across all <mark>seven nations</mark>.<br>
    Along the way, they master multiple <mark>elements</mark> without a Vision while searching for answers and their lost family.
  </p>
  <img src="https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/topstrongest/images/0/0f/TravelersInfo.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20220209181022" alt="Travelers" width="500" height="800">

  <hr>

  <h3>But there are some Characters that just got released Like <mark>Odette</mark>:</h3>
  <p>
    Odette is a mysterious new figure in <mark>Teyvat</mark> whose past is still shrouded in dark secrets.<br>
    Driven by a personal vendetta, she navigates the shadows of the nations while hiding her true motivations from those around her.<br>
    Her unexpected arrival catches the attention of the Traveler, as her fate seems deeply tied to the upcoming conflicts.
  </p>
  <img src="https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/f/f3/Odette_Card.png/revision/latest?cb=20260703040217" alt="Odette" width="500" height="800">

  <hr>

  <h3>And we got Varesa</h3>
  <p>
    <mark>Varesa</mark> is an easy-going warrior and orchard owner from Natlan's <mark>Collective of Plenty</mark>.<br>
    Adored by local children as the "<mark>Masked Hero</mark>", she possesses immense martial strength alongside a legendary, <mark>insatiable appetite</mark> for food.<br>
    Despite her relaxed lifestyle, she is highly dedicated to defending her nation against any incoming threats.
  </p>
  <img src="https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/a/a7/Varesa_Card.png/revision/latest?cb=20250217100445" alt="Varesa.img" width="500" height="800">

  <br><br>
